  "termsTitle": "Terms of Use",
  "termsSection1Title": "Introduction",
  "termsSection1Body": "Welcome to Souqak. By using the app or creating an account, you agree to these terms. Please read them carefully. If you do not agree, please do not use the service.",
  "termsSection2Title": "App Usage",
  "termsSection2Body": "You may use Souqak to buy and sell goods and services within the laws of Iraq. Posting misleading, illegal, or offensive content is prohibited. We reserve the right to remove any content that violates these terms without prior notice.",
  "termsSection3Title": "User Rights",
  "termsSection3Body": "You retain ownership of content you post. You grant Souqak a non-exclusive license to display it within the app for service purposes. You have the right to edit your profile, listings, and delete your account.",
  "termsSection4Title": "Responsibilities",
  "termsSection4Body": "You are responsible for the accuracy of your account information, listings, and interactions with other users. Souqak is an intermediary platform and does not guarantee every listing or transaction. We recommend verifying products and sellers before purchasing.",
  "termsSection5Title": "Termination",
  "termsSection5Body": "We may suspend or terminate your account if you violate these terms or are suspected of fraudulent activity. You may also delete your account at any time from the app settings.",
  "privacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacySection1Title": "What Information We Collect",
  "privacySection1Body": "We collect information you provide during registration such as name, email, phone number, and username, as well as listing data you publish and your in-app messages. We may also collect technical data such as device type and IP address for security and service improvement purposes.",
  "privacySection2Title": "How We Use Your Data",
  "privacySection2Body": "We use your data to operate your account, display your listings, enable communication between users, and send notifications related to smart alerts and messages. We also use aggregated data to improve the user experience, prevent fraud, and ensure platform security.",
  "privacySection3Title": "Data Sharing",
  "privacySection3Body": "We do not sell your personal data to third parties. We may share limited information with service providers who help us host data and send notifications, subject to confidentiality obligations. We may disclose information upon lawful request or to protect user rights and platform safety.",
  "privacySection4Title": "Data Security",
  "privacySection4Body": "We apply technical and organizational measures to protect your data from unauthorized access, loss, or modification. However, absolute security of any internet transmission cannot be guaranteed, so we recommend using a strong password and not sharing login credentials.",
  "privacySection5Title": "Contact Us",
  "privacySection5Body": "If you have questions about the privacy policy or wish to exercise your data rights, you can contact us through the support email listed in the app settings. We will respond to your requests as soon as possible in accordance with applicable laws.",
